marta: Quick heads-up — the guided playground samplekit (Edge RSC + Llama adapter) flakes when streaming + ephemeral token refresh. Repro attached.

jonah: Can you paste the repro steps? I can help triage.

marta: Repro steps:
1) Deploy the samplekit to Vercel Edge
2) Call /api/generate with an ephemeral token that rotates every ~60s
3) After the token rotates the SDK retry triggers but the stream doesn't resume — request just hangs.
Snippet:
```js
await fetch('/api/generate', {
  method: 'POST',
  headers: { 'Authorization': `Bearer ${EPHEMERAL}` },
  body: JSON.stringify({ prompt })
})
```
Logs show `stream waiting for HEAD` and then a `fetch aborted` when retry happens.

samir: Seems like an SDK-parity + streaming edge quirk. Node/server SDK wraps retries around the whole response promise; the Edge streaming path never re-attaches a stream on retry. Quick workaround: set `stream: false` or bump token TTL. Long-term we should add a retryable streaming path to the SDK.

tina: I can repro on Vercel Edge runtime only — SSR/node hosts are fine. Vercel Edge's fetch stream can be consumed only once; when retry happens the new fetch isn't wired into the original stream. Suggest sample kit detect ephemeral auth and fall back to non-streaming with a clear note.

jonah: Practical change: detect EPHEMERAL tokens in sample + default to non-streaming, and file an SDK issue to handle streaming retries. Also adding a tiny client-side retry wrapper would help.

marta: I'll open a PR with two small commits: (1) sample change to prefer non-streaming when ephemeral auth is used, (2) a mini-eval that runs a generation while rotating the token mid-stream to catch regressions. Will include README snippet for token rotation handling: 
```js
// naive stream retry wrapper for demo only
async function fetchWithStreamRetry(url, opts, retries = 2) {
  try {
    return await fetch(url, opts);
  } catch (e) {
    if (retries <= 0) throw e;
    await refreshToken(); // implement token refresh in sample
    return fetchWithStreamRetry(url, {
      ...opts,
      headers: { ...opts.headers, Authorization: `Bearer ${EPHEMERAL}` }
    }, retries - 1);
  }
}
```

